# BOREALISv2Servo training baseline, 2026-10-10.
# For current LSM6DSO32 ROTATION_NONE firmware and pictured mounting:
# components up, ARM-button edge toward nose, servo-connector edge toward tail.
# Non-inverted SBUS requires the matching BOREALIS firmware and receiver bridge.
# No GPS, compass, airspeed sensor or onboard log storage installed.
# This is a partial parameter preset, not a complete flight-ready configuration.
# Calibrate each board/radio; configure and test failsafes separately.
AHRS_ORIENTATION 14
AHRS_EKF_TYPE 0
GPS1_TYPE 0
COMPASS_ENABLE 0
ARSPD_TYPE 0
ARSPD_USE 0
LOG_BACKEND_TYPE 0
ARMING_SKIPCHK 8
SERIAL2_PROTOCOL 23
SERVO1_FUNCTION 70
SERVO2_FUNCTION 4
SERVO3_FUNCTION 19
SERVO4_FUNCTION 21
SERVO5_FUNCTION 0
SERVO6_FUNCTION 0
